      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Available now.\n\n**When applying for this property, please provide as much information as possible about all applicants. The more information we have the better as we receive a large amount of applications daily**\n\nGet Let is delighted to bring this two bed town house to the rental market. Located in the private residential development Verdemont, this property comes to the market in exceptional condition. The ground floor briefly comprises an entrance hallway with a split stairway, a separate modern kitchen with all mod cons and a large bright living room leading out to a private garden terrace and a communal garden. The first floor comprises of a fully tiled bathroom and two double bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from an en suite. Both bedrooms include integrated wardrobes. \n\nLocated just a two minute walk from The Blanchardstown Shopping Centre and just five minutes walk to Coolmine Train Station this property provides access to a wide range of amenities and transport systems. Ample parking available. This modern town house is in exceptional condition, so viewing is highly recommended. \n\nTo arrange a viewing please email Michelle Hoare using the Send Message link and submit a brief application with details about yourselves. Private viewings shall then take place by appointment only. \n\nGet Let is a subsidiary of Get Property Limited, PSRA number 002324."
